# Pick the demo object up from the configured fixed_grasp_pose and set it
# down at the configured fixed_place_pose — both FIXED config values, no
# perception, no arguments. The demo object is fragile (a raw egg): safe
# gripping requires a LOW gripper_force in jaka_arm's config (applied
# once at connect; the skill cannot change it per call).
#
# Request has no fields — the tool takes no arguments ({}).
---
# Whether the flow completed (every waypoint converged; non-fatal lift
# failures are reported in `message`).
bool success

# Human-readable status. On failure, names the failing stage (preflight /
# grasp/open / approach / descend / grasp/close / lift /
# fixed_grasp/approach / fixed_grasp/descend / fixed_grasp/open /
# fixed_grasp/lift).
string message

# How long the whole call took (s).
float32 elapsed_s
